{#
  ROADMAP.md Phase 11 #105 - the automated Thursday send (items 24/31)
  only ever mailed Mount Prospect's digest, since Buttondown's free plan
  is one undifferentiated list with no per-region segmentation. The
  signup form is on every region page, so a subscriber from any other
  region got the wrong town's weekend - a real defect the moment the
  list has anyone on it besides the owner. This is the fix: one issue,
  one short block per region, so every subscriber finds their own town
  in the same email.

  Same email-client constraints as email_digest.html.j2 (tables only,
  system fonts, explicit colors everywhere) and the same preview/send
  split (item 91). The dark-mode CSS (item 92) is the one piece
  actually shared, via {% include "_email_dark_mode.css.j2" %} below -
  a code-review pass found the two copies had drifted apart in comments
  (though not in the rules themselves) and that "Jinja2 has no
  cross-template partial mechanism" was simply wrong: both templates
  already render through the same FileSystemLoader Environment in
  scripts/build_digest.py, so an include resolves fine. Everything else
  below stays a second self-contained file rather than a shared
  fragment - the table markup differs enough (one region block that
  repeats vs. one flat body) that forcing it through shared partials
  would cost more in indirection than it saves in duplication.
#}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>{{ subject_line }}</title>
<style>
{% include "_email_dark_mode.css.j2" %}
</style>
<!--[if mso]>
<noscript>
<xml>
<o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
<o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
</o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
</xml>
</noscript>
<![endif]-->
</head>
<body class="wt-page" style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f4f3f1;" bgcolor="#f4f3f1">
{# ROADMAP.md item 207: hidden preheader - see email_digest.html.j2's
     own copy of this comment for the full rationale. #}
<div style="display:none; font-size:1px; line-height:1px; max-height:0px; max-width:0px; opacity:0; overflow:hidden; mso-hide:all;">{{ preheader }}&#8203;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&#8203;</div>
{# Owner request 2026-11-07: "simple and modern, without so many colours
     that contrast with one another". One neutral palette: white cards on a
     light warm-grey page, near-black text, grey secondary text, and the
     brand red only for links and small labels. No per-town colour blocks,
     no yellow pills, no dashed borders. Same email-safe rules as before
     (tables, inline styles, bgcolor attributes, system fonts, no images);
     the 600px column stays fluid (width 100%, max-width 600). #}
{% set ink = '#201e1d' %}{% set body_ink = '#45413e' %}{% set muted = '#6f6a66' %}{% set rule = '#e8e5e1' %}{% set accent = '#ae1800' %}{% set chip = '#f4f3f1' %}
{% set sans = "-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" %}
{% set serif = "Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif" %}
{% set hero_bg = {'halloween': '#2a1646', 'holiday': '#14532d'}.get(edition, accent) %}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f4f3f1" class="wt-page" style="background-color:#f4f3f1;">
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding:20px 12px;">
<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%; max-width:600px;">

{% if preview %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-accent wt-border" style="padding:0 8px 12px 8px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; color:{{ accent }}; border-bottom:1px solid #d7d3d3;">
PREVIEW ONLY, NOT PART OF THE EMAIL — SUBJECT LINE: {{ subject_line }}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 12px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{# Masthead: a thin accent rule (the edition's colour in Halloween and holiday weeks), then plain type on white. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-top:4px solid {{ hero_bg }}; border-radius:12px; padding:26px 26px 22px 26px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td class="wt-accent" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:10px;">
{% if edition == 'halloween' %}🎃 THE HALLOWEEN WEEKEND ISSUE{% elif edition == 'holiday' %}🎄 HOLIDAY KICKOFF{% else %}WITHIN TEN &nbsp;·&nbsp; WEEKEND GUIDE{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ serif }}; font-size:28px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.2; color:{{ ink }}; padding-bottom:10px;">
This weekend, across the northwest suburbs
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ muted }};">
<strong class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }};">{{ weekend_date_range }}</strong>{% if event_total %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ event_total }} thing{{ 's' if event_total != 1 else '' }} to do{% if town_total > 1 %} in {{ town_total }} towns{% endif %}{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:14px; border-top:1px solid {{ rule }}; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.8;">
{% for block in region_blocks %}<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ body_ink }}; text-decoration:none; white-space:nowrap;">{{ block.region_name }}</a>{% if not loop.last %}<span class="wt-muted" style="color:#c9c4bf;"> &nbsp;·&nbsp; </span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>

{% for o in on_sale %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 483: the week's time-critical item in its own card, directly under the masthead. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border:2px solid {{ ink }}; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:8px;">⏰ ON SALE {{ o.opens.strftime('%A').upper() }} AT {{ 'NOON' if (o.opens.hour == 12 and o.opens.minute == 0) else o.opens.strftime('%-I:%M %p').replace(':00', '').upper() }}</div>
<div class="wt-ink" style="font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ ink }}; padding-bottom:12px;">{{ o.emoji }} {{ o.line }}</div>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr>
<td bgcolor="{{ ink }}" style="background-color:{{ ink }}; border-radius:8px;"><a href="{{ o.url }}" style="display:inline-block; padding:9px 16px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">Official page &rarr;</a></td>
{% if o.remind_url %}<td style="width:10px;"></td><td style="border:1px solid #cfcac5; border-radius:8px;"><a href="{{ o.remind_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="display:inline-block; padding:8px 15px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; font-weight:600; color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">⏰ Remind me</a></td>{% endif %}
</tr></table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endfor %}

{% if weather_line or election_line or closures_line or days_off_line or give_line or new_towns %}
{# ROADMAP.md items 291, 296, 307: the week's short notices, as plain lines in one card. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;">
{% if weather_line %}<div class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; padding:3px 0;">{{ weather_line }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if election_line %}<div style="padding:3px 0;"><a href="{{ election_line.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ election_line.text }} &rarr;</a></div>{% endif %}
{% if closures_line %}<div style="padding:3px 0;"><a href="{{ closures_line.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ closures_line.text }} &rarr;</a></div>{% endif %}
{% for n in new_towns %}<div style="padding:3px 0;"><a href="{{ n.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;"><strong>New:</strong> {{ n.name }} &rarr;</a></div>{% endfor %}
{% if give_line %}<div style="padding:3px 0;"><a href="{{ give_line.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ give_line.text }} &rarr;</a></div>{% endif %}
{% if days_off_line %}<div style="padding:3px 0;"><a href="{{ days_off_line.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ days_off_line.text }} &rarr;</a></div>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if rain_plan %}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:8px;">☔ RAIN PLAN: INDOOR PICKS</div>
{% for e in rain_plan %}
<div style="padding:4px 0; font-size:15px;"><a href="{{ e.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">{{ e.title }}</a> <span class="wt-muted" style="font-size:13px; color:{{ muted }};">{{ e.pick_town }} · {{ e.email_when or e.date }}</span></div>
{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if edition_block %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 289: the seasonal edition's first block, above "Don't miss". #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:8px;">{{ edition_block.title|upper }}</div>
<div class="wt-ink" style="font-size:14px; line-height:2.1; color:{{ ink }};">{% for pill in edition_block.pills %}<span style="display:inline-block; background-color:{{ chip }}; border-radius:6px; padding:1px 10px; margin:0 6px 4px 0; white-space:nowrap;">{{ pill }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
{% if edition_block.night_line %}<div class="wt-ink" style="padding-top:8px; font-size:15px; color:{{ ink }};">🌙 {{ edition_block.night_line }}</div>{% endif %}
{% if edition_block.trunks %}<div class="wt-ink" style="padding-top:8px; font-size:15px; color:{{ ink }};"><strong>Trunk-or-treats this weekend</strong>{% for t in edition_block.trunks %}<div style="padding-top:2px;">{{ t.when }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ t.town }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {% if t.url %}<a href="{{ t.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ t.title|display_title }}</a>{% else %}{{ t.title|display_title }}{% endif %}</div>{% endfor %}</div>{% endif %}
<div style="padding-top:10px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;"><a href="{{ edition_block.link }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ edition_block.link_label }}</a></div>
{% if edition_block.extra_link %}<div style="padding-top:6px; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;"><a href="{{ edition_block.extra_link }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ edition_block.extra_label }}</a></div>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if seasonal_link %}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; font-weight:600;">
<a href="{{ seasonal_link.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ seasonal_link.label }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if top_picks %}
{# "Don't miss": one standout per town, chosen by pick_email_top_picks(). #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:20px 22px 6px 22px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td class="wt-accent" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:12px;">
DON'T MISS THIS WEEKEND
</td>
</tr>
{% for pick in top_picks %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td width="40" valign="top" style="width:40px; font-size:24px; line-height:30px;">{{ pick.email_emoji }}</td>
<td valign="top">
<a href="{{ pick.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ serif }}; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; line-height:1.3; color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ pick.title|display_title }}</a>
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:3px;">{{ pick.pick_town }} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {{ pick.email_when or pick.date }}</div>
{% if pick.google_calendar_url %}<div style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; padding-top:4px;"><a href="{{ pick.google_calendar_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">📅 Add to Google Calendar</a></div>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if poll %}
{# ROADMAP.md items 331, 334: one question for the whole season, as a card. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ ink }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:6px;">DID YOU GO?</div>
<span class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }};">Did you go to something from last week's email?</span> &nbsp;<a href="{{ poll.went }}" style="display:inline-block; background-color:{{ ink }}; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; padding:6px 14px; border-radius:6px;">Yes</a> <a href="{{ poll.not_yet }}" class="wt-ink" style="display:inline-block; border:1px solid #cfcac5; color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; padding:5px 13px; border-radius:6px;">Not this time</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if signups %}
{# ROADMAP.md items 327, 334: sign-ups opening this week, grouped by title and venue. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ ink }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:6px;">📝 SIGN-UPS OPENING THIS WEEK</div>
{% for e in signups %}
<div style="padding-top:4px;"><span class="wt-ink" style="font-weight:600; color:{{ ink }};">{{ e.town }}</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ e.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ e.title }}</a>, <span class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }};">{{ e.sessions_label }}</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <span class="wt-muted" style="color:{{ muted }};">sign-ups open {{ e.opens_label }}</span>{% if e.remind_url %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; <a href="{{ e.remind_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">⏰ Remind me</a>{% endif %}</div>
{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if night_out %}
{# ROADMAP.md items 284, 334: one "Night out" line for the adult readers, as a card. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:16px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ ink }};">
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-size:12px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1.5px; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:6px;">NIGHT OUT</div>
<a href="{{ night_out.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; font-weight:600; text-decoration:none;">{{ night_out.title|display_title }}</a><span class="wt-muted" style="color:{{ muted }};">{% if night_out.venue %} at {{ night_out.venue }}{% endif %}, {{ night_out.when }} ({{ night_out.town }})</span>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% for block in region_blocks %}
{% if block.one_line %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 481: another town, as one line, for a reader whose own town is shown in full. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:14px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; line-height:1.45;">
<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ block.one_line }} <span class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }};">&rarr;</span></a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 10px 0;"></td></tr>
{% else %}
{# Region block: {{ block.region_name }} #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:20px 22px 20px 22px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="padding-bottom:6px; border-bottom:1px solid {{ rule }};">
<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ serif }}; font-size:21px; font-weight:bold; color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ block.region_name }}</a>
</td>
</tr>

{% if block.attendable_events %}
{% for event in block.attendable_events[:4] %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:14px 0;{% if not loop.first %} border-top:1px solid {{ rule }};{% endif %}">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td width="46" valign="top" style="width:46px;">
<table role="presentation" width="46" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr><td align="center" bgcolor="{{ chip }}" style="background-color:{{ chip }}; border-radius:8px; padding:6px 0 7px 0;">
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:10px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; color:{{ muted }};">{{ event.email_dow or "WKND" }}</div>
<div class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:19px; font-weight:600; line-height:22px; color:{{ ink }};">{{ event.email_daynum or event.email_emoji }}</div>
</td></tr>
</table>
</td>
<td valign="top" style="padding-left:14px;">
{% if event.sponsored_by %}
<div class="wt-accent" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.5px; text-transform:uppercase; color:{{ accent }}; padding-bottom:3px;">Featured &middot; Presented by {{ event.sponsored_by }}</div>
{% endif %}
<a href="{{ event.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; line-height:1.35; color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ event.title|display_title }}</a>
{% if event.email_clock or event.email_where %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:3px;">{% if event.email_clock %}<span class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }};">{{ event.email_clock }}</span>{% if event.email_where %} · {% endif %}{% endif %}{% if event.email_where %}{{ event.email_where }}{% endif %}</div>
{% elif not event.email_dow and event.date %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:3px;">{{ event.date }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.email_blurb %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ body_ink }}; padding-top:4px;">{{ event.email_blurb }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.recurrence_note %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 141: same muted treatment as email_digest.html.j2. #}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:3px;">🔁 {{ event.recurrence_note }}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.email_badges %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:6px;">{% for badge in event.email_badges %}{{ badge.label }}{% if not loop.last %} &nbsp;·&nbsp; {% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
{% endif %}
{% if event.google_calendar_url %}<div style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; padding-top:5px;"><a href="{{ event.google_calendar_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">📅 Add to Google Calendar</a></div>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
{% elif block.evergreen_highlights %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; color:{{ muted }}; padding:12px 0 6px 0;">
Nothing new dated for this weekend yet, but worth knowing about:
</td>
</tr>
{% for item in block.evergreen_highlights %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:6px 0; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px;">
<a href="{{ item.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">{{ item.title|display_title }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
{% elif not block.informational_events %}
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-top:12px;">
Nothing dated for this weekend yet — the full guide has what's coming up.
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{% if block.indoor_ideas %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 312: a thin week gets up to three evergreen indoor ideas, labelled so they are never mistaken for dated events. #}
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; color:{{ muted }}; padding:12px 0 6px 0;">
Indoor ideas, anytime this week:
</td>
</tr>
{% for item in block.indoor_ideas %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:6px 0; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px;">
<a href="{{ item.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">{{ item.title|display_title }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if block.informational_events %}
{# ROADMAP.md Phase 11 #90, applied here independently of the branch
     above (a region with only a half-day/closure and no attendable
     events must not silently drop it). #}
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="{{ chip }}" style="background-color:{{ chip }}; border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px;">
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:1px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-bottom:2px;">ALSO THIS WEEK</div>
{% for item in block.informational_events[:2] %}
<div class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; color:{{ body_ink }}; padding-top:3px;">{{ item.title|display_title }}{% if item.date %} — {{ item.date }}{% endif %}</div>
{% endfor %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{% if block.sponsor and block.sponsor.is_active_sponsor %}
<tr>
<td style="padding-top:12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="border:1px solid {{ rule }}; border-radius:8px; padding:10px 14px;">
<span class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.5px; color:{{ muted }};">LOCAL RECOMMENDATION —</span>
<a href="{{ block.sponsor.url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px;">{{ block.sponsor.title }}</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

<tr>
<td style="padding-top:14px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; font-weight:600;">
<a href="{{ block.region_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none;">See everything in {{ block.region_name }} &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if empty_regions_summary %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 177: regions with nothing dated collapse into one
     shared block once 2+ qualify at once. #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 22px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-bottom:8px;">
Nothing dated yet in {{ empty_regions_summary.names }} — worth knowing about:
</td>
</tr>
{% for entry in empty_regions_summary.entries %}
<tr>
<td style="padding:6px 0; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px;">
<a href="{{ entry.region_url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">{{ entry.region_name }}</a>{% if entry.highlight %} — <a href="{{ entry.highlight[0].url }}" class="wt-ink" style="color:{{ ink }}; text-decoration:none;">{{ entry.highlight[0].title }}</a>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
{% endfor %}
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 14px 0;"></td></tr>
{% endif %}

{% if house_ad %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 169: house ads appear at most once per issue. #}
<tr>
<td style="padding-bottom:14px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td style="border:1px solid #dcd8d3; border-radius:12px; padding:12px 18px;">
<span class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:0.5px; color:{{ muted }};">SPONSOR THIS SPOT —</span>
<span class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; color:{{ muted }};">{{ house_ad.detail }}</span>
{% if house_ad.url %} <a href="{{ house_ad.url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px;">Learn more &rarr;</a>{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}

{# Footer #}
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#ffffff" class="wt-paper" style="background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:12px; padding:24px 22px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
{% if newsletter.configured %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 183: forwarding is the one free growth channel, so a
     forwarded copy must carry a way to subscribe - a plain link to
     Buttondown's hosted page, since forms are stripped by many clients. #}
<tr>
<td align="center" class="wt-ink" style="font-family:{{ serif }}; font-size:18px; font-weight:bold; color:{{ ink }}; padding-bottom:12px;">
Forwarded this? Get your own every Thursday
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" style="padding-bottom:14px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="{{ ink }}" style="background-color:{{ ink }}; border-radius:8px;">
<a href="https://buttondown.com/{{ newsletter.buttondown_username }}?utm_source=email&utm_campaign=forward" style="display:inline-block; padding:11px 22px; font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:15px; font-weight:600; color:#ffffff; text-decoration:none;">Get your own weekend guide &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:14px; padding-bottom:16px;">
<a href="{{ text_friend_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">Text this week's picks to a friend &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
{% endif %}
{# ROADMAP.md item 157: a reply is a stronger deliverability signal than
     a click, and replies reach a real inbox (item 93). #}
<tr>
<td align="center" class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:13px; line-height:1.5; color:{{ body_ink }}; padding-bottom:8px; border-top:1px solid {{ rule }}; padding-top:14px;">
Know about something we missed? Hit reply — we read every one.{% if newsletter and newsletter.event_form_url %} Running an event? <a href="{{ newsletter.event_form_url }}" style="color:{{ accent }};">Add it free</a>.{% endif %}
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; color:{{ muted }}; padding-bottom:8px;">
See Within Ten first when you search: <a href="{{ preferred_source_url }}" class="wt-brand" style="color:{{ accent }}; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;">add us as a preferred source on Google &rarr;</a>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td align="center" class="wt-muted" style="font-family:{{ sans }}; font-size:12px; color:{{ muted }};">
Within Ten — local events within ten miles, pulled automatically from each village, library, and park district.
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
